@baseUrl = http://localhost:7070
@email = local.customer@example.test
@password = LocalTestPassword123!
@token = paste-the-token-returned-by-login



### Register a customer without an address (expected: 201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Local test customer",
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Log in as an existing account (customer, courier, restaurant owner or admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}"}

### Check which account the token belongs to
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Missing token: 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me

### Invalid token: 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer invalid


